Value Required SWITCH_ID (\d+)
Value CURRENT_BOOT (\S+)
Value NEXT_BOOT (\S+)
Value MANUAL_BOOT (\S+)
Value ENABLE_BREAK (\S+)

Start
  ^Switch\s+${SWITCH_ID}
  ^\s*BOOT variable = ${CURRENT_BOOT};
  ^Boot Variables on next reload: -> GetNextBoot

GetNextBoot
  ^\s*BOOT variable = ${NEXT_BOOT};
  ^\s*Manual Boot\s*=\s*${MANUAL_BOOT}
  ^\s*Enable Break\s*=\s*${ENABLE_BREAK}
  ^--------------------------- -> Record Start